# XSH 2.6 File Descriptor Allocation
# Copyright (c) 2026 Nicholas Martin. All rights reserved.
#
# The rule is stated once, here, for every function that allocates a
# descriptor. Each function gets its own assertion in this module.

assertion  XSH.2.6-file-descriptor-allocation.001
anchor     functions/V2_chap02.html#2.6
class      required
since      1988
says       open() returns the lowest-numbered descriptor that is not open
           in the calling process.
test       t/001-open-lowest.c
